'''Koga''' (Japanese: '''キョウ''' ''Kyou'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Put your {{TCGP|Muk}} or {{TCGP|Weezing}} in the Active Spot into your hand.
}}

